                "description": "Emtek's Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt is an excellent example of clean, sleek lines that are the defining characteristics of modern door hardware. The Single Cylinder Contemporary Deadbolt is available in a wide array of stylish finishes. It is easy to install and will fit doors 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.\r\n",
